## Request

Create a durable consolidation contract from current repository evidence: capability families,
layer ownership, keep/merge/move/replace/retire dispositions, runtime and test baselines, protected
invariants, and a rule requiring future features to consume, replace, or retire an existing surface
or explicitly justify net-new runtime growth.

Implement one bounded read-side project projection that resolves authority once and produces both
the dashboard's executive state and its exhaustive lifecycle inventory. Move the dashboard to this
seam without changing hosted payload fields or privacy behavior, retain thin private wrappers for
compatibility, and prove a report constructs the project world only once.

Use that seam as the only foundation delivered for IDEA-0028. Record which overview/status/dashboard
surfaces 100k must absorb or replace; do not implement the 100k presentation, add another state
authority, remove public commands, release, publish, or synchronize clients in this campaign.

Stop after focused implementation proof, strict Doctor, configured development deployment/checks,
exact Work2 release-cohort registration, and a durable Hybrid checkpoint.

